e product\",\n     \"3: Stock status reflects most recent nightly import, not real-time\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-8\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Basket management and order placement with delivery date and note\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Buyer adds a product to basket; basket quantity updates\",\n     \"1: Buyer changes quantity in basket; total updates accordingly\",\n     \"2: Buyer removes a product from the basket\",\n     \"3: Buyer selects a delivery date at checkout, constrained to earliest allowed date (next working day if before 14:00, else day after)\",\n     \"4: Buyer can add an optional free-text note to the order\",\n     \"5: Submitting an order with an invalid/past delivery date is rejected with an error\",\n     \"6: Placing an order with an empty basket is rejected with an error\",\n     \"7: Successful order placement creates an order record with status 'received'\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-9\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Reorder previous order with stock-flagging before confirmation\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Buyer selects a past order and system populates a new basket with the same lines in one action\",\n     \"1: Lines that are now out of stock are visibly flagged in the basket before the buyer places the order\",\n     \"2: Buyer can remove or adjust flagged out-of-stock lines before placing\",\n     \"3: Buyer can still place the order with out-of-stock lines flagged as warning, not blocked\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-10\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Saved basket templates with custom names, reusable across sessions\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Buyer saves current basket contents under a name (e.g. 'Weekly order')\",\n     \"1: Buyer can view a list of saved templates\",\n     \"2: Buyer selects a saved template and it populates the basket with those items/quantities\",\n     \"3: Saving a template with a duplicate name either overwrites or is rejected with an error message\",\n  