m all customers via a back-end queue\",\n     \"2: System supports ~300 buyers, 15 staff, up to 150 orders/day without performance degradation\",\n     \"3: All pages render usably on a phone screen, especially buyer-facing screens\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-2\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Standard email/password auth with self-service reset\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Buyer submits email+password on sign-in form; correct credentials grant access to their dashboard\",\n     \"1: Incorrect credentials show an error without revealing whether email exists\",\n     \"2: Buyer requests password reset via email; reset link/token sent to registered email address\",\n     \"3: Reset link expires after a set time; expired/used link shows an error\",\n     \"4: Buyer sets new password via reset link, then can sign in with new password\",\n     \"5: Passwords stored hashed, never displayed in plaintext\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-3\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Admin-driven invitation flow for both staff and buyers\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Admin enters an email address and role (staff or buyer) to send an invite\",\n     \"1: Invited person receives email with a unique setup link\",\n     \"2: Invited person uses link to set their own password and activate account\",\n     \"3: Expired or already-used invite link shows an error and cannot be reused\",\n     \"4: Only admin role can send invites; buyers/staff cannot access invite screen\",\n     \"5: Duplicate invite to an already-active email is rejected or flagged\"\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"id\": \"I-4\",\n    \"readingChosen\": \"Strict company-level data isolation for buyers\",\n    \"behaviours\": [\n     \"0: Buyer's order list, invoice list, and address book only show records tied to their own company account\",\n     \"1: Direct URL access to another company's order/invoice/address returns a permission error (403/not found)\",\n     \"2: Staff and admin are not restricted this